'''Monkey King''' (猿王 En ō) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Dragon Poker Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 2.2 Update#Version 2.2.3 Update|Version 2.2.3]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Monkey King
|image = E 068.png
|appearance = [[Dragon Poker Collaboration Event]]
|money drop = 1,080円 - 4,266円
}}

==Enemy==
An enemy with average health and low damage and range.  This enemy is no threat to those that go against it since many attackers are able to outrange it.

==Strategy==
Units like [[Gross Cat (Normal Cat)|Gross Cat]] as well as [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|both]] [[Crazed Lizard Cat (Super Rare Cat)|lizards]] can deal with this enemy with ease.

